        "Turtles responded more strongly to the **rewarded signature** than to either **mismatched combination**. Neither the rewarded inclination paired with the wrong intensity nor the rewarded intensity paired with the wrong inclination produced the response that the complete trained field evoked. The learned response therefore depends on the full combination of the two parameters, and the response to the rewarded field is the product of that combined match.",
